From 9d15a1282c54238a8f55532304c2a7fd44522454 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:33:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [zigbee] OTA: confirm a new image only once the OTA server
 answers

After a Zigbee OTA the new image keeps the bootloader rollback armed
until the coordinator answers a Query Next Image (sent every 30 s) or
offers an image. Without an answer within confirm_timeout (default
10 min) the device rolls back: an image that boots but cannot reach the
Zigbee network could not be updated again. safe_mode gets
hold_app_confirmation()/release_app_confirmation() so its
boot_is_good_after does not confirm the image first.

Idea from github.com/jabla/esphome-hiflow-zigbee.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TAigdDwPTsH7gxNNraUrHU
